riginal ten-channel STUMPY8/16, then fixed 80% STUMPY squared distance +20% causal cycle-context squared distance. No outcome tuning of weights.","twoStage":"Keep provisional membership predictions for unfinished samples. pMembership is descriptive among resolved historical memberships, with unresolved count and bounds; no unfinished case is relabeled negative. pEvent/pEvent8 separately estimate full median completion inside the frame and within8. Conditional price estimate uses only completed historical targets; >=12 distinct target days, otherwise current-median fallback. One pseudo-count per class; no calibrated-confidence claim.","selection":"Trial selection uses validation price MAE only if >=10 common ready target days, else WAIT/no chosen trial. Keep Jul17 validation and Aug21 final-test boundaries from preceding work. Test metrics are descriptive when selector WAIT.","limits":"Previously inspected archive; this new target has not been forward validated. Variable event timing cannot honestly be drawn as a fixed eight-point price path. No website promotion. Paired circular five-day bootstrap,5000 draws,97.5% intervals; >=30 target days required."},"schema":"wlr-aba-v2","publishedAt":1792649532545,"liveLimit":"Historical scores concern first eligible segment snapshots, including European opening candle 0 using preceding closed history when ready. An already-open segment may be selected for a new causal live forecast; that later entry has not been separately forward validated.","collection":{"source":"daily-archive","status":"delayed","checkedAt":1792649447543,"lastTimeBySymbol":{"SPYUSDT":1792558800000,"QQQUSDT":1792558800000},"lagHours":24.93}}